# Python style

- Prefer the simplest code that does the job.
- Small functions, clear names, and type hints on public functions.
- Use `pathlib.Path` and f-strings.
- Keep docstrings short. Say why when the why is not obvious.
- Ruff checks this repo. Line length is 100. The selected rules are E, F, and I. Settings live in [pyproject.toml](../../pyproject.toml).
- Formatting does not change behaviour.
